  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おや、君たち、
また来たのかい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, it's you kids! It's
nice to see you again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あぁ、まぁな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, uh, yeah. You too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何の用事だい？
それとも今日は
遊びに来たのかい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What can I do for you? Or
are you just stopping by?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あいにく、僕も忙しくて
相手してられないけど、
ゆっくりしていきな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sorry to say, but I'm actually quite
busy at the moment, so I won't
have much time to talk...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……忙しいのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Busy with what?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだね、前に言ってた、
“人が魔術の恩恵を得る方法”
ってのを研究中だから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, it's the research I mentioned
before. "A way for humans to
reap the benefits of magic."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうそう、君たち、
水精石って持ってないかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, now that I think of it, you
wouldn't happen to have any
Aqua Spirit Gems, would you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270376</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あったかな……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh, not sure...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たぶん、ないと思うけド……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't think so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そっか……んじゃあ、
見つけたら、持ってきて
もらってもいいかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... Well, if you find any, could
I ask you to bring them to me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだな……
１０個くらい
あればいいかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I should only need ten or so.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>別にオレたち使わないと
思うし、構わないぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't think we can really
use'em, so...yeah, sure.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270716</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも１０個も
集まるかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But...will we even
find that many...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270804</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、無理に、とは
言わないから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, no, no need to
go out of your way.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270804</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、
よろしくね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, then, I'll see you later.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
